{"resource":{"id":"react-frequently-asked-questions","title":"React.js — Frequently Asked Questions","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"11 min","pages":16,"lastUpdated":"May 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"FAQs from beginner to advanced: JSX, components, props, state, hooks, Context, routing, forms, APIs, performance, testing, deployment, React 19, careers."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"basics","label":"Basics"},{"id":"components","label":"Components & Props"},{"id":"state","label":"State & Hooks"},{"id":"context","label":"Context & Routing"},{"id":"forms","label":"Forms & APIs"},{"id":"perf","label":"Performance"},{"id":"testing","label":"Testing & Deployment"},{"id":"react19","label":"React 19 Features"},{"id":"career","label":"Career Guidance"},{"id":"code","label":"Common Snippet"},{"id":"table","label":"Concept Comparison"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"refs","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"45 min"},{"title":"React.js — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"5 min"},{"title":"React.js — Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Answer the 100 most-asked React questions in one place.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Curated from Stack Overflow, Reddit, and thousands of interviews.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"basics\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Basics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>What is React? Why JSX? Virtual DOM? Difference from Angular/Vue? Do I need Redux?</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Overview diagram for basics.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"components\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Components &amp; Props</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Functional vs class? When to lift state? How to pass data up? What are children?</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"state\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">State &amp; Hooks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>useState vs useReducer? useEffect vs useLayoutEffect? Custom hooks — when? Why do hooks have rules?</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"context\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Context &amp; Routing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Context vs Redux? When does Context re-render? React Router vs TanStack?</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"forms\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Forms &amp; APIs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Controlled vs uncontrolled? React Hook Form? How to handle file uploads? SWR vs React Query?</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"perf\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Performance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>When to memo? Bundle size targets? SSR vs CSR vs SSG? React Compiler — what changes?</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"testing\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Testing &amp; Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Which library? How to test hooks? Deploy where? CI setup?</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Reference visual for testing & deployment.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"react19\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">React 19 Features</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Actions, useOptimistic, useFormStatus, useActionState, ref as prop, document metadata, Compiler.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Career Guidance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Portfolio &gt; certifications. Contribute to OSS. Read source code. Interview prep timeline.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"code\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Snippet</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import { useState, useEffect } from &quot;react&quot;;\n\nexport function useDebounced&lt;T&gt;(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const id = setTimeout(() =&gt; setV(value), ms);\n    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(id);\n  }, [value, ms]);\n  return v;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"table\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Concept Comparison</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Concept</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">When to use</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useState</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Local UI state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Not for shared state</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useReducer</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Complex transitions</td><td class=\"border p-2\">More boilerplate</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">Context</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Cross-cutting concerns</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Re-renders consumers</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">React Query</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Server state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Extra dep</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Read react.dev cover to cover before Googling.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Trusting outdated blog posts. React changes fast — check the date.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Follow @dan_abramov2 and @acdlite on X for authoritative takes.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Answers age. Fundamentals don't.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I get started?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Read the sections in order, then apply immediately to a project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this current for React 19?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — content reflects React 19 and the Compiler.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where can I ask questions?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Open an issue in the EduNova AI community or ask the in-app AI tutor.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"refs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Reflects React 19 as of May 2026.</p>\n      </div></section>"}